<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>items</key>
	<array>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>温控解除</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>改完重启用户空间，或 killall thermalmonitord，才生效。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>启用插件</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>enabled</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.lqx3617.thermalfuse</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>强制 nominal 模拟模式</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>forceNominal</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.lqx3617.thermalfuse</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>屏蔽温度传感器上报</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>blockSensorEvents</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.lqx3617.thermalfuse</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>改写 ThermalMonitor 配置</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>patchThermalPlist</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.lqx3617.thermalfuse</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>关闭 CPMS 缓解（激进）</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>blockMitigation</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.lqx3617.thermalfuse</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<false/>
		</dict>

		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>档位引擎</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>满频 = 按系统给过的最高功率上限跑；低功耗 = 按下面的比例压；智能 = 不干预，只受下面的游戏/定时规则影响。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSListItemsCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>常驻档位</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>level</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.lqx3617.thermalfuse</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<string>auto</string>
			<key>titles</key>
			<array>
				<string>智能</string>
				<string>低功耗</string>
				<string>满频</string>
			</array>
			<key>values</key>
			<array>
				<string>auto</string>
				<string>low</string>
				<string>max</string>
			</array>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSEditTextCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>低功耗比例 %</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>lowRatio</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.lqx3617.thermalfuse</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<string>40</string>
			<key>placeholder</key>
			<string>30-70，默认 40</string>
			<key>keyboard</key>
			<string>numbers</string>
			<key>isNumeric</key>
			<true/>
		</dict>

		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>游戏识别</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>前台 App 命中下列前缀就切满频，退出自动回落。多个用英文逗号隔开，匹配的是 bundle id 前缀，比如 com.tencent.tmgp</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSEditTextCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>游戏 bundle 前缀</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>games</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.lqx3617.thermalfuse</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<string>com.tencent.tmgp,com.miHoYo,com.netease,com.activision,com.ea</string>
			<key>placeholder</key>
			<string>com.tencent.tmgp,com.miHoYo</string>
		</dict>

		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>定时切档</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>格式：08:00-22:00=max;23:00-07:00=low，多个用分号隔开，跨零点写成 23:00-07:00。留空 = 不启用。定时规则优先于游戏识别。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSEditTextCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>时间表</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>schedule</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.lqx3617.thermalfuse</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<string></string>
			<key>placeholder</key>
			<string>08:00-22:00=max;23:00-07:00=low</string>
		</dict>

		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>背光功率上限</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>留空或 0 = 不改写。单位与系统 plist 一致（mW 量级）。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSEditTextCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>功率值</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>cpuMaxPower</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.lqx3617.thermalfuse</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<string></string>
			<key>placeholder</key>
			<string>仅数字，0 表示不改</string>
			<key>keyboard</key>
			<string>numbers</string>
			<key>isNumeric</key>
			<true/>
		</dict>

		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>自检与调试</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>自检 30 秒，采样 15 次，结果写到 live plist 的 reportText，并在 syslog 打一行。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>启动后自动自检</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>selfTestOnStart</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.lqx3617.thermalfuse</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>输出日志</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>verbose</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.lqx3617.thermalfuse</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<false/>
		</dict>
	</array>
</dict>
</plist>
